    app -> css "m7 · GET resource (vp)" {
      technology "HTTPS"
      notes """
        **Phase 4 — presentation to the CSS** (trace `6ed104ef…`). In the model m7 = (m6, sig(hash(m6), sk_a)):
        the app wraps the user's VP (`vc.wrapPresentation`) and signs it (`vc.signWrappedPresentation`),
        sending it in the `vp` header. The CSS runs `css.VpChecker.verifyNew` →
        `vc.verifyWrappedPresentation` (app signature) → `vc.verifyPresentation` (user signature and VC).

        `vp` header — wrapped VP (outer proof by the app, inner proof by the user):

        ```json
        {
          "@context": [
            "https://www.w3.org/2018/credentials/v1",
            "https://bboi.solidcommunity.net/public/schemas/202…p.jsonld"
          ],
          "id": "https://example.com/wrappedVP/321122",
          "type": [
            "VerifiablePresentation"
